        "ID": "Combined",
        "Description": "A combined sample is one created by combining two or more acquired samples. For example, acquired separator liquids and gases are recombined to mimic the original reservoir conditions. Or for example, multiple rock samples from the same or similar facies are combined (stacked on top of each other) for core analysis measurements.",
